    "detailed_description": "<strong>Story</strong><br>Take control of a young man who struggles to find a place in the world and doesn't know what lies before him. Even with an easy life and a few downfalls, he feels like it's been only a failures. Living in the city of Los Edenos he cannot afford to be down bad. Until he's approached with a life-changing offer, that can potentially bring him closer to a life he thinks he deserves... Or ruin everything. Discover people's stories around you and your inevitable consecration into a world of crime. Build relationships with them. Your choices may or may not get you what you desire.<br><br><strong>Game Features</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Free-roam, point and click navigation with interactable environment and dating-sim elements.<br></li><li>Uniquely created 3D instances.<br></li><li>High quality QHD renders and animations.<br></li><li>Event replay allowing you to relive every event, times and times again.</li></ul><br>",
